                                "sense_id": "cc21de78-e67c-3b0e-9246-d7b7178c244a",
                                "text": "It constitutes, as it were, the dandydom, the fine-ladydom, the ornamental portion of the denomination to which it belongs; the ribbons, and false flowers, and tinsel, and spangles, and gimcracks of the old lady's cap."
                            },
