                                "sense_id": "cc21de78-e67c-3b0e-9246-d7b7178c244a",
                                "text": "Though all the servants knew of my rejecting the state of ladydom, the less familiar pair rejected me outright because of that attitude. Only a mad person, they believed, required convincing to become superior in English society […]"
                            }
